  "body": "Enjoy modern comfort and convenience in this brand-new duplex, ideally located close to Takapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping, and public transport.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully Designed Across Three Levels\r\nGround Floor: Internal-access single garage, spacious living area, full bathroom, and direct garden access. Ideal for guests or a potential fifth bedroom.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: Stylish kitchen with premium Miele appliances, open-plan living and dining, sunny waterproof deck, and an additional bedroom.\r\n\r\nUpper Floor: Three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite, plus a family bathroom and study nook.\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nFreehold title with no body corporate fees\r\nApprox. 186sqm floor area\r\n10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\nConcrete block inter-tenancy wall\r\nMiele appliances and fully tiled bathrooms\r\nDouble glazing, full insulation, and two heat pumps\r\nQuality finishes and internal-access garage\r\nPrime Location & Schooling\r\n\r\nWalking distance to Smales Farm, the Busway Station, Takapuna Hospital, and Takapuna CBD. Takapuna Beach and popular local eateries are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nExcellent schooling options include Westlake Girls and Boys High Schools, Takapuna Grammar, Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Carmel College, Rosmini College, and St Joseph’s Primary.\r\n\r\nA Fantastic Opportunity\r\n\r\nPerfect for families, professionals, or investors seeking modern living in a sought-after location. Contact us today to arrange a viewing!",
